# Docs are read by many and reviewed by few. A tracked text file silently classified
# BINARY is undiffable, so no edit to it is ever reviewable. That happened to a skill
# read by 14 clones and nobody noticed for weeks. Start diffable.
*.md   text diff
*.py   text diff
*.toml text diff
